A vibrant cyberpunk scene of a neon-lit Bangkok cityscape at night, where towering skyscrapers are covered in glowing circuit board patterns and holographic data streams. In the foreground, a diverse group of silhouetted figures gather around a floating, translucent workstation that projects cascading layers of interconnected geometric shapes and flowing code structures into the humid night air. The scene is bathed in electric blues, hot magentas, and acid greens reflecting off rain-slicked streets. Traditional Thai temple spires peek between futuristic buildings, their golden surfaces catching the digital glow. Steam rises from street vendors below while data particles drift upward like digital fireflies, creating a sense of excitement and collaborative energy in this fusion of ancient culture and cutting-edge technology.
